    12	  SERVER_ERROR            5xx response                      (P001 F_5XX*)
    13	  UNDOCUMENTED_STATUS     status not listed and no `default`
    14	  RESPONSE_SCHEMA         body violates the documented schema (P001 F_OAS)
    15	  INVALID_ACCEPTED        request violates the spec but got 2xx (P001 F_2XXP)
    16	  VALID_REJECTED          request conforms but got 400/422    (P001 F_400)
